{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_02_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_02","title":"不幸重逢","storyCode":"FC-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"eb35670a6ffb54b2085dfa9f4269bbd877d793c396da97204618fae4c97f21f2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"隨商隊尋找深池部隊蹤跡的風笛和陳制止了塔拉流民打劫，葦草說明自己也同樣在追蹤深池之後，風笛和陳表示願意幫助她。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些該死的塔拉人！真倒楣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"砍！用力砍！給他們點教訓！告訴他們別想再伸手拿別人的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好，給塔拉人一點教訓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到沒有，你們這些渣滓？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......手臂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......你敢說，我們塔拉人......該死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......打啊，我們打死這些做生意的！看看是誰該死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼就用刀鞘砸？我可是給你們付了錢的，給我認真一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一柄刀鞘夠用。你們再動手，我會連你們一起攔下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，我和風笛只是和你們同行，不是你雇的保鏢，別認錯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你和那邊拿矛的傢伙一樣，也是個怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我們之前聽說的消息是真的，一般的商隊，不敢來這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那個領頭的......你這身衣服，很顯眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走，陳小姐，我們得走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎麼突然害怕了？我聽到你這張嘴，剛剛還說要教訓一下塔拉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"深池......鬼魂部隊，你們這些瘋子！果然塔拉人多的地方，就會撞見這些鬼魂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，別說惹了我們，只是看到我們的樣貌，都是會被殺人滅口的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟朋友追查了這麼久，對那支鬼魂部隊該有的樣子，還是心裡有數的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，請帶著商隊儘快離開。這裡的流寇，我和風笛攔住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後追查深池部隊的事，我們自己去，不必再麻煩你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊首領","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......唉，真倒楣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還想追？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，塞爾蒙，想想辦法！我們得追上去弄死這些人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅是物資的事......他們跑掉之後，一定會把事情報給警察，還有那些當兵的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還用得著你說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚，憑你們的武力，越不過我的劍。所以剛才，你想虛張聲勢，嚇退我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們現在怎麼辦？你總該有辦法吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......難怪即使這身打扮會給你帶來危險，你卻仍選擇這樣穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想當這支隊伍的“領袖”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是輕輕地撞一下，應該只會頭暈一會。我救人質的時候試過好幾次了，不會出錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，昏過去了。是不是我太用力了？還是說，你們難道已經幾天沒吃飽飯了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......可是，搶劫也是不對的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——別想偷襲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"長槍從身後揮來的瞬間，風笛本能地出手格擋。\n雙方各退一步。看清對方後，風笛睜大了眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——葦草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的傷好了？沒關係了？你怎麼在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不對不對，你也是來搶劫的嗎？那我就不能放你過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，是我沒來得及阻止他們動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，無論如何，我不想讓他們受傷......也不想讓他們被抓捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那我們要做的事情差不多呀，你不用這麼戒備地盯著我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論作為維多利亞的軍人，還是羅德島幹員，我們都不可能傷害平民。我和陳陳都是來勸架的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，不過，不好意思，我的力氣可能對普通人來說有點大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不我幫你把這些昏倒的人背到陰涼處休息吧？他們是住在這座村莊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......請你，離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝突已經化解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這麼說，可我還是想幫幫忙呀。看起來，你好像有什麼顧忌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧，你還是不喜歡說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島的時候，他們就不許我探望你，也不肯告訴我為什麼。我只能猜，是不是你不願意想起小丘郡的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是你怎麼跑到這裡來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，看起來還像是在荒野裡迷路了好多天一樣。你的任務是什麼呀，要不要我和陳陳陪你一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，想問你的事情太多啦，我的腦子都有些亂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒關係。我只是，偶然被這些人邀請......護送他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，我一個人在野外行動了很長時間，荒野上的危險，對我來說不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也不是在為羅德島執行任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在追蹤與深池相關的一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪......我和陳陳也是，所以我們才會在這裡撞見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在小丘郡的時候，你都受了那麼重的傷，一定也很在意深池......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池裡，有人改變了我的命運，所以我想......試試還能不能從那裡扳回來什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是緩解他們帶去的痛苦，還是讓我自己感到平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟著商隊往這個方向走，原本就是想找一支最近出現在附近的深池部隊。也不知道為什麼，看到你的時候，我真的嚇了一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，你們跟深池一點關係都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，我去和陳陳說一說，任務先緩幾天。她一定也很願意幫助這些人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜，剛剛我是在幾個人的盯梢下走進這間會客室的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你要如何在塔拉人和維多利亞人之間表演不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我實在應該感謝你特意趕來特倫特郡吸引視線。我以為，你會在軍隊中隱藏更長時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖的計劃走到這一步，我是威靈頓公爵的近衛隊成員，還是深池的軍官，這兩個身份已經沒有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然監視你的是開斯特的人，那他們應該早就掌握了這一情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市外不斷出現小股深池部隊，還有深池大軍經過的傳言......這些就是做給他們看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上一些神神秘秘的貿易訂單，現在恐怕連八卦一些的商人都已經知道，那位鐵公爵對這座城市有所圖謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都在四處打探，拼命猜測，那位公爵想借特倫特郡的舞台做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很符合領袖的期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，如果我們真正的目的地被過早發現，各位公爵提前知道了領袖的決心，恐怕橡林郡外也會像倫蒂尼姆一樣熱鬧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，他們是更怕薩卡茲，還是更怕塔拉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把塔拉人和魔族相提並論？你沒資格開這種玩笑，維多利亞的菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我聽說“間諜”死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，從那以後，我們能得到的倫蒂尼姆城內的情報就大幅度減少了，確實可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡不僅有薩卡茲，還蟄伏著一些......挺有意思的勢力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就說過，你的感情用事一定會毀掉你的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感情用事？會這樣想我的人可真是不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該想著給蔓德拉找一條生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被“雄辯家”利用，試圖分裂深池，本該和那六個叛徒一同死在小丘郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉是“間諜”最信任的人，在確定“間諜”是否會背叛之前，處決她可算不上什麼明智之選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救援“間諜”的任務，哪怕不值得你我親自去，也應該換一個更穩妥的人去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這麼說，我和你關係不睦，沒機會害死你，這對你來說不是個好消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無意義的油嘴滑舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在公爵大人和領袖做出最終決定之前，你可不能輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能看出倫蒂尼姆情報的重要性，我怎麼會看不出呢。可我們最終會不會向倫蒂尼姆進軍，現在還是未知數呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取決於公爵之間的合作進展？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，不然我現在是在為什麼奔走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。我還記得四年前在飛地上的那場戰役，我們是怎麼苦苦等待大貴族們的合作結果的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與此同時，心思各異的使者在幾千公里外來回周旋，耐心地拉扯數周，只為了跟公爵說上一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮，你最好是站在領袖這邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉已死，你想幫她的小心思我可以不再追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那個人還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你是說親愛的可憐的拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雄辯家”在小丘郡的陰謀不能再重演。只要她活著一天，對深池與領袖的威脅就始終存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖把掌控她行蹤的任務交給了你。別再讓私情影響你，阿赫茉妮。你失敗不了太多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你對一名職業間諜的感情生活真是懷抱著太多幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，別惡狠狠地盯著我了，“校官”大人，除非你想幫我化妝。我還有一場宴會要去呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是不錯的嘛，維恩，就跟那時候一樣。我總以為你沒什麼本事，結果你每次都能辦成一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，借來這點口糧，又有什麼用呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩個人，應該是維多利亞人吧？她們說了，能去城鎮替我們把用不著的東西換出去，也能給你們弄到防身的棍棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有像樣的武器，你不該感到高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，拿你的小收音機聽聽，廣播裡有沒有商隊被打劫的事情。說不定那些膽小鬼怕被深池報復，根本不敢報警......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，維恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在回頭張望什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那幾個感染者，從村子出來後就一直遠遠地跟著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還跟著啊？我們走得這麼快，以那幾個病人的腿腳，還帶著小孩，居然還能追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他們要跟上我們，多不容易啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我在擔心莫蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的眼睛在幾年前那次饑荒裡就壞了，夜裡看不見路。現在敲過了熄火鐘，路上連一盞燈都沒剩下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，聽起來還挺可憐。那請問他們跟著我們做什麼？難道我們看起來像是什麼救援隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，呃，可能是因為你這身衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧，除了我以外，其他人都是把你當成真正的深池來對待的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都知道，深池會對塔拉人好，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，去找他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你嚇我一跳......你的聲音怎麼在發抖？你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有更多人輪流站崗放哨，不是壞事......我們躲避巡邏隊會更容易一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......帶上他們一起走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
